-- These have live mount_params records (so MF.scan() correctly reports them),
-- but they are noise as top-level "things to edit" in the platform picker -
-- weapons/backpacks that happen to occupy a record slot, or duplicate
-- catalog rows for the same defensive structure. Excluded from the GUI's
-- Mount platform dropdown only; MF.scan()/browser/category totals are
