-- entity data (7.1.0): every mount_params record whose unit is player-side
-- (faction Super Earth / none, content/fac_helldivers/...). Everything else in
-- mount_params - Automatons, Terminids, Illuminate, objective props, ship crew -
-- is read-only: it is hidden from the picker and the browser, and MF.apply()
-- refuses to write it. PLATFORM_EXCLUDE above still only hides entries from the
-- picker; those stay editable from the console.
