          <CheatEntries>
            <CheatEntry>
              <ID>1500092056</ID>
              <Description>"Open me for notes about things that are 'prone to desync' or 'Squad sync'"</Description>
              <LastState/>
              <Color>0000FF</Color>
              <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
              <AssemblerScript>[ENABLE]
{
1. Cosmetic desync scripts may have cosmetic Issues between clients.
If you care about this kind of thing, It is recommended you ask everyone to enable
the overclock. But usually I don't bother, it doesn't matter too much.

=====================||All Cosmetic Desync overclocks||==========================
One-two : The Haymaker : Other players may see regular grenade explosions rather than the
intended shotgun effect.

Trident : Talon Lens Mod Kit : Other players see the regular spread of the trident rather
than the tightened spread.

Exploding Crossbow : Heavy Crossbow : Other players will not see the Increased projectile
drop.

Exploding Crossbow : Titanium Bolts : Other players may see regular explosions rather
than the intended silent effect.

Dominator : Explosive Gyrojets : Other players will not see or be affected by the
added explosion.

Punisher Plasma : Dense Plasma : Other players will not see the Increased projectile
drop.

Purifier : Ultra-dense plasma : Other players will not see the Increased projectile
drop.

Evictor : Pipe Grenades : Other players will not see the Increased projectile drop.

Speargun : Explosive Harpoon : Other players will see the regular gas explosion than
the explosive one.

Beltfed-GL : SABOT Rounds : Other players will not see the increased projectile drop.

Beltfed-GL : Cat-2 Special : Other players may see regular grenade explosions rather
than the intended shotgun effect.

Epoch : High Density Plasma : Other players will not see the Increased projectile
drop.

======================================||||=======================================

2. Minor Desync scripts may have small issues in terms of properly syncing certain effects
between people. This is something that can have minor effects on gameplay somewhat commonly.

Major desync scripts can technically be used without other players having it enabled,
but it's likely a bad idea due to the way the overclock works.

====================||All Minor &amp; Major Desync overclocks||======================
Dominator : Explosive Gyrojets : Other players will not see or be affected by the
added explosion.

Eruptor : Sabot Rounds : Other players will see and will be affected by the Shrapnel
of the vanill erupotr despite this overclock removing the Shrapnel. They'll also see
and be affected by the vanilla AoE despite this overclock making the AoE smaller.

Lib Concussive : Explosive Rounds : Other players will not see or be affected by the
added explosion.

Deployable Shield : Booster Emitter : Other players will not see the increased size
of the shield. Defeating almost the entire purpose of the overclock, which is to
help your teammates.

======================================||||=======================================

3. Squad sync stratagems require ALL players in the lobby to enable it. No questions
asked. It creates extremely aggressive desyncs otherwise that can affect everyone in
the lobby, even people with the script properly enabled.

==========================||All Squad Sync overclocks||==========================

Orbital Precision Strike : Napalm Payload : Just a bad idea. Less of a bad idea than
the others, but still a bad idea.

120mm Barrage : Rapid Firing Mechanism : Bad idea.

380mm Barrage : Carpet Bomb : Bad idea.

======================================||||=======================================
}
[DISABLE]
</AssemblerScript>
            </CheatEntry>
            <CheatEntry>
