///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
This overclock is intended to be used with the 'Weakpoint Lock-on' mod. But can be used without it.
https://ayakamods.com/mods/weakpoint-lock-on-v2.3981/
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
        High Precision Rounds
        [Balanced Overclock]
++ Large direct damage boost (25 --&gt; 105)
+ Large durable damage boost (9 --&gt; 25)
+ Increase in magazine size (11 --&gt; 14)
- No stun effect on unguided rounds
-- No AOE whatsoever
}
