        Stolen Pelican Turret
        [Unstable Overclock]
++ Now fires shells identical to the Autocannon Sentry/Pelican Turret (40mm Shell)
+ Added sniper-level magnified scope (50m --&gt; 50m, 100m, 200m)
+ Explosive armor penetration increased (AP3 --&gt; AP4)
- Locked to burst fire mode (Not like it'll matter.)
-- Less ergonomics (17 --&gt; 0)
-- Unable to use FLAK firing mode.
-- Significantly increased recoil (101x 275y --&gt; 170x 550y)
-- Mag size reduced (10 --&gt; 8)
-- Rounds reloaded per clip reduced (5 --&gt; 3)
(The following is the 40mm Shell's default stats compared to the default AC:)
++ Increased direct damage (325 --&gt; 450)
++ Increased durable damage (260 --&gt; 450)
+ Increased direct armor penetration (AP4 --&gt; AP5)
+ Increased stagger force (30 --&gt; 40)
+ Increased knockback/push force (20 --&gt; 40)
+ Increased explosion radius (2i 4o 5.5s --&gt; 2i 6o 8s)
}
